msgid "UNDOING THE REBALANCING"
msgstr "DESHACIENDO EL REEQUILIBRADO"

msgid "{n} run is waiting for new databases."
msgid_plural "{n} runs are waiting for new databases."
msgstr[0] "{n} reequilibrado espera bases nuevas."
msgstr[1] "{n} reequilibrados esperan bases nuevas."

msgid "REWRITE DATABASES WITH MEDIA COMPOSER"
msgstr "REESCRIBIR LAS BASES CON MEDIA COMPOSER"

msgid "{n} folder differs from its database"
msgid_plural "{n} folders differ from their database"
msgstr[0] "{n} carpeta difiere de su base de datos"
msgstr[1] "{n} carpetas difieren de su base de datos"

msgid "Media Composer only rewrites the databases of folders named like its own. That takes three steps:"
msgstr "Media Composer solo reescribe las bases de las carpetas con un nombre como los suyos. Son tres pasos:"

msgid "Rename – each folder below gets the next free number (“1”, on network drives “<computer>.1”). Its original name and every media file are remembered."
msgstr "Renombrar: cada carpeta de abajo recibe el siguiente número libre («1», en unidades de red «<ordenador>.1»). Se recuerdan su nombre original y cada archivo de medios."

msgid "Start Media Composer – it scans these folders and writes new msmFMID.pmr and msmMMOB.mdb files."
msgstr "Abrir Media Composer: analiza estas carpetas y escribe archivos msmFMID.pmr y msmMMOB.mdb nuevos."

msgid "Quit Media Composer and rename the folders back under Check DBs › New databases – they get their old names and keep the new databases."
msgstr "Cerrar Media Composer y devolver el nombre a las carpetas en Comprobar BD › Bases nuevas: recuperan su nombre antiguo y conservan las bases nuevas."

msgid "LOOKING FOR DUPLICATES"
msgstr "BUSCANDO DUPLICADOS"

msgid "LOOKING FOR FULL FOLDERS"
msgstr "BUSCANDO CARPETAS LLENAS"

msgid "REBALANCING FOLDERS"
msgstr "REEQUILIBRANDO CARPETAS"

msgid "SETTING DUPLICATES ASIDE"
msgstr "APARTANDO DUPLICADOS"

msgid "CHECKING THE MXF DATABASES"
msgstr "COMPROBANDO LAS BASES MXF"

msgid "Every ticked folder gets its original name back. Untick a folder to leave it renamed for now. Folders whose database Media Composer has not rewritten yet keep their old database."
msgstr "Cada carpeta marcada recupera su nombre original. Desmarca una carpeta para dejarla renombrada por ahora. Las carpetas cuya base Media Composer aún no ha reescrito conservan su base antigua."

msgid "Rename back ({})"
msgstr "Recuperar el nombre ({})"

msgid "{} → {}"
msgstr "{} → {}"

msgid "database not rewritten yet"
msgstr "base aún no reescrita"

msgid "New files since renaming:"
msgstr "Archivos nuevos desde el cambio de nombre:"

